# meshcraft
===
 Meshcraft is a free, open-source direct mesh modeler. Build with edges and faces, reshape geometry in the viewport, and turn your work into dynamic objects with independent instances. Use it as a hands-on modeler, or create geometry with JavaScript and connect an agent through MCP.
